// More operations that may leave their range than fix once had rounds for, in one function: the check reports every
// one of them, so one round of fixes covers them all, and every one of them gets its try.
typealias Integer = int(i64.min to i64.max)

function sink(x Integer) returns Integer
	return try x + 1 otherwise panic("out of range")
end 'sink'

